{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"lazy","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LazySequence","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s12LazySequenceV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Inherited from ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sequence.lazy","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/lazy"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/lazy"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques"]]},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"externalID":"s:STsE4lazys12LazySequenceVyxGvp::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V","roleHeading":"Instance Property","extendedModule":"Swift","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"lazy","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LazySequence","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s12LazySequenceV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"modules":[{"relatedModules":["Swift"],"name":"Cliques"}],"role":"symbol","title":"lazy","symbolKind":"property"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques/lazy":{"abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/lazy","title":"lazy","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"lazy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"LazySequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:s12LazySequenceV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/lazy","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","url":"\/documentation\/cliques","type":"topic","abstract":[],"title":"Cliques","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MaximalCliques"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MaximalCliques"}],"title":"MaximalCliques","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every maximal clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph once, lazily, each in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order (by vertex index): an isolated vertex, or one whose only edges are loops, is a clique of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. The order is Eppstein–Löffler–Strash’s: by the cliques’ first vertex in"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", then as Bron–Kerbosch with Tomita’s pivot (ties to the least","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"index) and branches in ascending index meets them. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"degeneracy d."}]}}}